  "title": "PG: Byzantine Fault-Tolerant and Privacy-Preserving Sensor Fusion with Guaranteed Output Delivery",
  "abstract": "We design and implement PG, a Byzantine fault-tolerant and privacy-preserving multi-sensor fusion system. PG is flexible and extensible, supporting a variety of fusion algorithms and application scenarios.",
